- op: discuss  # 0e7a
  at: '2026-07-19T23:44:49Z'  # 0e7a
  by: agent  # 0e7a
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 0e7a
  clock: 3  # 0e7a
  nonce: 0e7a  # 0e7a
  message: "INV-zogud ramp progress (2026-07-19, autonomous 'crush mypy' session). KEY MEASUREMENT FINDING: INV-zogud's statement is 'mypy <repo>' — a WHOLE-TREE invocation where cross-package imports resolve. The current CI job runs mypy PER-PACKAGE in a loop (mypy $mod), which cannot follow cross-package imports (the editable install is mypy-invisible) so it treats every cross-package symbol as Any. That both INVENTS phantom errors (e.g. all 118 untyped-decorator — register_analyzer resolves to Any per-package; 0 whole-tree) and HIDES real ones (arg-type 117 per-package vs 571 whole-tree). So the per-package counts (231 basic / 1445 strict) are NOT the INV-zogud target. The real target = whole-tree 'mypy <all pkg src dirs>' strict + pyright-resonant config = measured at 1359 errors at session start. PR #(origin) landed: widened Symbol/Edge.origin + Edge.create param to str|List[str] (the INV-jidat scalar-or-list normalization contract) — resolved 465 arg-type (34% of the surface, ONE root cause) at the ir.py chokepoint (not the 465-site sweep the through-line forbids); generate_schema_lib.py taught that Union[X,List[X]] serializes as array[X] so docs/schema.json is byte-identical. Whole-tree strict now 888. Remaining is grind-dominated: type-arg 447 (bare dict 308/list 65/set 26 — mechanical hygiene), no-untyped-def 69, assignment 65, no-any-return 39, unreachable 32, union-attr 30, arg-type 105 residual, index 23, operator 14, name-defined 7 (6 = scip_pb2 generated protobuf), no-redef 4 (WI-hokag). Multi-session. Next structural step = WI-rokup keystone (switch CI to whole-tree strict + baseline ratchet)."  # 0e7a
